message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "goSPL-LandLab-Bridge"
abstract: "Lightweight add-on that runs Landlab landscape-evolution components (e.g., nonlinear hillslope diffusion, HyLands landslides) inside goSPL timesteps for source-to-sink forward modeling, without changing either code base. Developed in collaboration with Dr. Xuesong Ding."
type: software
authors:
